Subject: [PATCH] Add Visitor Management System (VMS) module

Implements the frozen VMS spec bundle (PS v1.2, CFR/AFR/UC/BR/WF v1.3) as an
API-only Django app mounted at /vms/:

- 39 use cases (UC-001..040, UC-029 retired), incl. event-triggered
  expiry, auto-checkout, offline reconciliation and approval reminders
- 47 business rules enforced in the service layer
- visit lifecycle state machine transcribed from the authoritative STTs,
  with every transition recorded against its STT row
- roles: Super Admin (designation), time-bound Admin/Security assignments,
  implicit Host, token-based visitor portal, key-based integrations
- reports with CSV/PDF export and anonymised views, live dashboard,
  emergency muster with roll-call and post-event report
- 274 spec-driven tests (UC, BR, WF, API)

